# Run artifacts. `.run/report.json` states `citable as evidence: false` about itself;
# it is a scratch verdict, never a record.
.run/

# Capture evidence from design-critique cycles. These are review material, not source:
# 393 PNGs / ~49 MB at the last count. The tools that write them are shipped; the output
# of one afternoon's review is not.
**/record/critique_*/
**/record/*.png

# Screenshot-tool output. Each of these embeds the ABSOLUTE local path of every PNG it
# wrote, which is how the operator's home directory ends up in a published tree.
# Regenerate with the relevant `tools/shoot.mjs`; never commit.
**/fixtures/shots/measurements.json
**/fixtures/shots/browser-mount-smoke.json
**/record/shots.json

# D5's reference corpus is local configuration: absolute paths to the older asset trees
# this module's code must not have inherited from. Committing them would leak one
# machine's layout AND the names of unpublished sibling projects, which is exactly what
# req/883 took out of discipline.test.mjs. Configure via this file or GX_REFERENCE_ROOTS.
membrane/test/reference-roots.local.json

# Editor / OS / transient
*.log
*.bak-*
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
